OL,3,GNEWSABullets hit microwave and wall in
OL,4,Ashooting targeting young child, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FBullets were found lodged inside a wall
OL,8,Fand microwave after a gang targeting a
OL,9,Fyoung child fired shots at the wrong
OL,10,Fhome, a court has heard.
OL,12,FA woman and her son were asleep inside
OL,13,Fthe house in Pyle, Bridgend, during the
OL,14,Fshooting in the early hours of 22
OL,15,FSeptember 2025, but neither were
OL,16,Finjured.
OL,18,FA jury at Cardiff Crown Court was shown
OL,19,Ffootage of two men firing a 9mm pistol
OL,20,Fat the house before fleeing on an
OL,21,Felectric motorbike.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
