OL,3,GNEWSABullets hit microwave and wall in
OL,4,Ashooting targeting young child, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe court heard the incident was
OL,8,Fcarried out in retaliation against
OL,9,Falleged drug dealer Daniel O'Callaghan
OL,10,Fafter the gang believed he had taken
OL,11,Fdrugs worth thousands of pounds from a
OL,12,Fhiding place in Guernsey.
